          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.284,
            0.902,
            0.362
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us consider the situation again, given in Section 5.1 in which Reena applied for a job and got selected. She has been offered the job with a starting monthly salary of ` 8000, with an annual increment of ` 500. What would be her monthly salary for the fifth year?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.367,
            0.901,
            0.406
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "To answer this, let us first see what her monthly salary for the second year would be."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.411,
            0.9,
            0.458
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "It would be "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "8000+500=8500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " In the same way, we can find the monthly salary for the 3rd, 4th and 5th year by adding ` 500 to the salary of the previous year. Se the"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.451,
            0.899,
            0.565
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "o, the salary for the 3rd "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\begin{aligned} year  &= \\mp (8500 + 500) \\\\&= \\mp (8000 + 500 + 500) \\\\&= \\mp (8000 + 2 \\times 500) \\\\&= \\mp (8000 + (3 - 1) \\times 500) \\\\&= \\mp 9000 \\\\&= \\mp 9000 \\quad \\cdots \\quad \\cdots \\quad \\cdots\\end{aligned}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (for the "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3rd year",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ")"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.567,
            0.901,
            0.682
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Salary for the 4th year "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\begin{aligned}&= \\vec{ 飞 } \\left( 9000 + 500 \\right) \\\\&= \\vec{ 飞 } \\left( 8000 + 500 + 500 + 500 \\right) \\\\&= \\vec{ 飞 } \\left( 8000 + 3 \\times 500 \\right) \\\\&= \\vec{ 飞 } \\left[ 8000 + \\left( \\mathbf{4} - \\mathbf{1} \\right) \\times 500 \\right] \\\\&= \\vec{ 飞 } 9500\\end{aligned}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (for the "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4th year",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ")"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.687,
            0.9,
            0.813
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Salary for the 5th year = ` (9500 + 500) = ` (8000+500+500+500 + 500) = ` (8000 + 4 × 500) = ` [8000 + "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5 – 1)",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " × 500] (for the "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5th year",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ") = ` 10000"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.822,
            0.605,
            0.869
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Observe that we are getting a list of numbers 8000, 8500, 9000, 9500, 10000, . . ."
            }
          ]
